  "description": "This library provides a simple way to create lambda expressions to filter lists and database queries.\n\t\t\tIt enables the creation, storage, and transmission of filters, making it useful for WebAPI requests,\n\t\t\tadvanced search screens, and relational queries.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
