  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.8 (includes 1.2.7 changes)\n\t\t\t- Fixed: LessThan / GreaterThan and other single-value operations on DateTime filters (end-of-day Value2 is now only applied to Between / unspecified operations).\n\t\t\t- Fixed: no-value operations (IsNull, IsNotNull, IsEmpty, IsNotEmpty, IsNullOrWhiteSpace, IsNotNullNorWhiteSpace) now work from JSON filters.\n\t\t\t- Fixed: In / NotIn on nullable properties (e.g. int?).\n\t\t\t- Fixed: Filter<T> with nullable types (e.g. Filter<int?>) no longer loses its value.\n\t\t\t- Improved: KeyExp supports any IEnumerable<T> collection (ICollection<T>, arrays, etc.), not only List<T>.\n\t\t\t- Added tests covering all operations, connectors and groups.",
